27:== Challenge ==
28:
29:* North-America *
30:If you are on-site in North-America Finals there is a machine setup with chrome. To get the flag you will need to come over and give us a HTTP/HTTPS URL to visit. There will be a flag if you run `/read_flag` but we will also give you the flag if you manage to pop gnome-calculator. Chrome will be run with `./chrome --no-sandbox` inside Ubuntu 18.04 Desktop
