32:* Other Sites *
33:For non North-America sites, there is a service that will load a given url in chrome for you. To get the flag, run `/read_flag`. In this case chrome will be run with `./chrome --headless --disable-gpu --no-sandbox --virtual-time-budget=60000 <your_url>` within an ubuntu 18.04 docker container. A proof of work will be asked before chrome runs, but a proof of work solver is provided.
